msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Mention|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Source Mention"
msgstr "来源提及"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Mention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An occurrence of source wording referring to an entity, located within one exact containing block and source revision. Resolution is optional; the occurrence is neither the entity nor a Note or Selector."
msgstr "指向实体的来源措辞出现，定位于一个确切包含块及来源修订内。解析可不提供；出现本身既不是实体，也不是 Note 或 Selector。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Mention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Mention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Mention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Mention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record a gmeow:Mention ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record a gmeow:Mention ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReference|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Internal Cross-reference Occurrence"
msgstr "内部交叉引用出现"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReference|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source occurrence pointing within one reference revision to a division or block. It retains its origin, local span and original wording even when no target has been resolved."
msgstr "在同一参考修订内指向划分或块的来源出现。即使尚未解析目标，也保留其起点、局部跨度和原始措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReference|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReference|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReference|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReference|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record a gmeow:CrossReference ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record a gmeow:CrossReference ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IndexEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Source Index Entry"
msgstr "来源索引条目"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IndexEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source record of one index entry's original term, subterm and locator wording, with an optional resolved Concept. Locator text is not itself resolved identity."
msgstr "记录一个索引条目的原始词条、子词条与定位措辞的来源记录，可带有已解析的 Concept。定位文本本身不是已解析身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IndexEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IndexEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IndexEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IndexEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record a gmeow:IndexEntry ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record a gmeow:IndexEntry ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionIn|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "mention in block"
msgstr "提及所在块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact containing ContentBlock whose original decoded text is the origin for this mention's zero-based half-open Unicode code-point span. Offsets are local to this block, not the whole reference."
msgstr "其原始解码文本作为此提及零起始、半开 Unicode 码点跨度起点的确切包含 ContentBlock。偏移限定于此块，而非整份参考资料。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:mentionIn ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:mentionIn ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "resolved mention referent"
msgstr "已解析提及指称对象"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An Entity explicitly resolved as the referent of this mention under the recorded source and viewpoint. Missing resolution remains absent; competing attributed resolutions do not merge entities."
msgstr "在所记录来源与视点下明确解析为此提及指称对象的 Entity。缺失解析保持缺失；相互竞争且有归属的解析不合并实体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mentionOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:mentionOf ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:mentionOf ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/surfaceForm|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "original occurrence wording"
msgstr "出现的原始措辞"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/surfaceForm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact original wording of a source occurrence, preserving its supplied language and direction. This literal is source data, not an analyzed lang:Form or a normalized entity name. It specializes lang:literalValue without changing its subject type."
msgstr "来源出现的确切原始措辞，保留已提供的语言和书写方向。此字面量是来源数据，而非已分析的 lang:Form 或规范化实体名称。 此属性特化 lang:literalValue，而不改变其主体类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/surfaceForm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/surfaceForm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/surfaceForm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/surfaceForm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:surfaceForm \"source wording\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:surfaceForm \"source wording\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersFrom|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "cross-reference source segment"
msgstr "交叉引用来源片段"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact source ContentSegment or ContentBlock whose original decoded text is the local origin for this cross-reference's code-point offsets. It is not forced into CreativeWork."
msgstr "其原始解码文本作为此交叉引用码点偏移局部起点的确切来源 ContentSegment 或 ContentBlock。不将其强制归入 CreativeWork。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersFrom|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersFrom|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersFrom|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:refersFrom ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:refersFrom ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersTo|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "resolved internal target"
msgstr "已解析内部目标"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersTo|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-resolved ContentSegment target within the same exact reference revision. It specializes references for the occurrence itself; the containing source reaches the target through the inverse refersFrom followed by refersTo path."
msgstr "来源在同一确切参考修订内解析出的 ContentSegment 目标。此关系为出现本身特化 references；包含来源通过 refersFrom 的逆关系后接 refersTo 的路径到达目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersTo|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersTo|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersTo|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refersTo|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:refersTo ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:refersTo ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTerm|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "original index term"
msgstr "原始索引词条"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTerm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original term heading of an index entry. Coexisting source literals preserve language and direction rather than selecting a preferred wording. It specializes lang:literalValue without changing its subject type."
msgstr "索引条目的原始主词条。共存的来源字面量保留语言和书写方向，而不选择优先措辞。 此属性特化 lang:literalValue，而不改变其主体类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTerm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:indexTerm \"source wording\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:indexTerm \"source wording\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexSubTerm|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "original index subterm"
msgstr "原始索引子词条"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexSubTerm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source's original subordinate index wording, retained without inventing a concept hierarchy or an absent parent entry. It specializes lang:literalValue without changing its subject type."
msgstr "来源的原始从属索引措辞，保留它而不虚构概念层级或缺失的父条目。 此属性特化 lang:literalValue，而不改变其主体类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexSubTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexSubTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexSubTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexSubTerm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:indexSubTerm \"source wording\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:indexSubTerm \"source wording\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexLocator|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "original index locator"
msgstr "原始索引定位信息"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexLocator|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source's original index locator wording, such as a page range, section code or see-reference. It remains textual evidence independently of any resolved target. It specializes lang:literalValue without changing its subject type."
msgstr "来源给出的原始索引定位措辞，例如页码范围、章节代码或参见引用。它独立于任何已解析目标，保持为文本证据。 此属性特化 lang:literalValue，而不改变其主体类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexLocator|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexLocator|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexLocator|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexLocator|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:indexLocator \"source wording\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:indexLocator \"source wording\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexConcept|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "resolved index concept"
msgstr "已解析索引概念"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexConcept|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual Concept explicitly resolved for an index entry. This link does not identify locator prose with a Concept or create a definition from an index heading."
msgstr "为索引条目明确解析出的实际 Concept。此链接不将定位散文等同于 Concept，也不从主词条创建定义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexConcept|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexConcept|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexConcept|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexConcept|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:indexConcept ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:indexConcept ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assumes|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "assumes source division"
msgstr "假定来源划分"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assumes|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed prerequisite reading that one ContentSegment assumes another. It creates no CreativeWork endpoint typing, universal prerequisite, transitive closure or execution obligation."
msgstr "表示一个 ContentSegment 假定另一个片段为前提的有归属解读。它不创建端点的 CreativeWork 类型、普遍前提、传递闭包或执行义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assumes|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assumes|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assumes|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assumes|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:assumes ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:assumes ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceSurface|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "supplied occurrence surface"
msgstr "所提供的出现表面形式"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceSurface|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An actual supplied language SurfaceForm for this occurrence's original wording. Its text agrees with surfaceForm and one of its anchors matches the exact local origin, span and code-point offset space; no analyzed form is fabricated."
msgstr "为此出现原始措辞提供的实际语言 SurfaceForm。其文本与 surfaceForm 一致，且其中一个锚点匹配确切局部起点、跨度和码点偏移空间；不虚构已分析形式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceSurface|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceSurface|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceSurface|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceSurface|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:occurrenceSurface ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:occurrenceSurface ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/navigationSource|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "exact navigation source revision"
msgstr "确切导航来源修订"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/navigationSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact source revision artifact identifying this navigation record or its origin or target segment. Its contentDigest is required; a mutable work identity, path or locator string cannot substitute for the revision."
msgstr "标识此导航记录及其起点或目标片段的确切来源修订制品。其 contentDigest 为必需；可变作品身份、路径或定位字符串不能替代该修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/navigationSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an explicit source occurrence, navigation field or prerequisite reading with its original evidence."
msgstr "用于保留明确的来源出现、导航字段或前提解读及其原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/navigationSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring resolution, identity, analyzed language structure or a universal reading from source text alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源文本推断解析、身份、已分析语言结构或普遍解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/navigationSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the exact revision, local coordinate origin, original words and exact-statement source and viewpoint; never invent missing targets or defaults."
msgstr "保留确切修订、局部坐标起点、原始话语以及确切陈述的来源与视点；绝不虚构缺失目标或默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/navigationSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source meaning: ex:record gmeow:navigationSource ex:target ."
msgstr "保留此来源含义：ex:record gmeow:navigationSource ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NavigationSourceDigestConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "navigation source revision digest"
msgstr "导航来源修订摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NavigationSourceDigestConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every explicitly selected navigation source revision retains a contentDigest of that exact artifact. This obligation does not calculate or authenticate a hash."
msgstr "每个明确选择的导航来源修订保留该确切制品的 contentDigest。此义务不计算或认证哈希。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NavigationSourceDigestConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NavigationSourceDigestConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NavigationSourceDigestConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NavigationSourceDigestConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:NavigationSourceDigestConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:navigationSource ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:NavigationSourceDigestConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:navigationSource ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "mention local span order"
msgstr "提及局部跨度顺序"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied mention span is nonempty and ordered within its exact local code-point origin. Numeric order alone does not verify a substring against source bytes."
msgstr "给出的提及跨度在其确切局部码点起点内非空且有序。仅凭数值顺序不能对照来源字节核验子字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSpanOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSpanOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSpanOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:MentionSpanOrderConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:mentionIn ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:MentionSpanOrderConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:mentionIn ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionOriginRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "mention origin revision agreement"
msgstr "提及起点修订一致性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionOriginRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The mention's local origin is bound to that same exact navigation source revision. Extra origin revision bindings must agree, preventing a local span from silently moving between editions."
msgstr "提及的局部起点绑定到同一确切导航来源修订。额外的起点修订绑定必须一致，防止局部跨度在不同版本间悄然移动。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionOriginRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionOriginRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionOriginRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionOriginRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:MentionOriginRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:mentionIn ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:MentionOriginRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:mentionIn ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "mention supplied surface anchor"
msgstr "提及所提供表面形式锚点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "When a language surface is explicitly supplied for the mention, one of its anchors names the same local origin, start and end under codepointOffset. A document-global or byte anchor cannot substitute for this local coordinate scope."
msgstr "当明确为提及提供语言表面形式时，其一个锚点在 codepointOffset 下命名相同的局部起点、开始和结束。文档全局锚点或字节锚点不能替代此局部坐标范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:mentionIn ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:MentionSurfaceAnchorConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:mentionIn ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "cross-reference local span order"
msgstr "交叉引用局部跨度顺序"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied cross-reference span is nonempty and ordered within its exact local code-point origin. Numeric order alone does not verify a substring against source bytes."
msgstr "给出的交叉引用跨度在其确切局部码点起点内非空且有序。仅凭数值顺序不能对照来源字节核验子字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersFrom ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:CrossReferenceSpanOrderConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersFrom ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "cross-reference origin revision agreement"
msgstr "交叉引用起点修订一致性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The cross-reference's local origin is bound to that same exact navigation source revision. Extra origin revision bindings must agree, preventing a local span from silently moving between editions."
msgstr "交叉引用的局部起点绑定到同一确切导航来源修订。额外的起点修订绑定必须一致，防止局部跨度在不同版本间悄然移动。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersFrom ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:CrossReferenceOriginRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersFrom ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "cross-reference supplied surface anchor"
msgstr "交叉引用所提供表面形式锚点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "When a language surface is explicitly supplied for the cross-reference, one of its anchors names the same local origin, start and end under codepointOffset. A document-global or byte anchor cannot substitute for this local coordinate scope."
msgstr "当明确为交叉引用提供语言表面形式时，其一个锚点在 codepointOffset 下命名相同的局部起点、开始和结束。文档全局锚点或字节锚点不能替代此局部坐标范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersFrom ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:CrossReferenceSurfaceAnchorConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersFrom ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "internal target revision agreement"
msgstr "内部目标修订一致性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied internal target belongs to the cross-reference's exact selected source revision. Extra target revision bindings must agree; unresolved targets remain absent."
msgstr "每个给出的内部目标均属于交叉引用所选择的确切来源修订。额外目标修订绑定必须一致；未解析目标保持缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersTo ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:CrossReferenceTargetRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:refersTo ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "supplied occurrence surface text agreement"
msgstr "所提供出现表面形式文本一致性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied occurrence surface retains the exact original surfaceForm literal, including supplied language and direction. All of that surface's text values must agree; lexical similarity alone does not merge forms."
msgstr "所提供的出现表面形式保留确切原始 surfaceForm 字面量，包括已提供的语言和书写方向。该表面形式的所有文本值必须一致；仅凭词法相似性不合并形式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of explicitly supplied navigation evidence."
msgstr "用于检查明确给出的导航证据的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law resolves a reference, authenticates bytes or executes text extraction."
msgstr "避免声称此定律解析引用、认证字节或执行文本提取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare only the recorded revision, origin, offsets and supplied anchors; preserve missing or disputed resolution without defaults."
msgstr "仅比较所记录修订、起点、偏移和已提供锚点；保留缺失或有争议的解析，而不使用默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:occurrenceSurface ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:OccurrenceSurfaceTextAgreementConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:occurrenceSurface ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-navigation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reference navigation"
msgstr "参考资料导航"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-navigation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Exact-source mentions, internal cross-reference occurrences, index wording and attributed segment prerequisites with local Unicode code-point coordinates."
msgstr "具有局部 Unicode 码点坐标的确切来源提及、内部交叉引用出现、索引措辞和有归属的片段前提。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-navigation|http://purl.org/dc/terms/title"
msgid "GMEOW Reference Navigation Module"
msgstr "GMEOW 参考资料导航模块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/reference-navigation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/sliceConsumer"
msgid "Katamari reference-work import and other attributed source consumers retaining unresolved wording, exact local spans and source revision identities without fabricated resolution."
msgstr "Katamari 参考作品导入及其他保留未解析措辞、确切局部跨度和来源修订身份而不虚构解析的有归属来源使用方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTarget|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "resolved index target"
msgstr "已解析索引目标"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTarget|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an IndexEntry to a ContentBlock explicitly resolved as a target of its recorded locator wording. The original locator remains separate source evidence, including when resolution is absent or ambiguous."
msgstr "将 IndexEntry 关联到明确解析为其已记录定位信息之目标的 ContentBlock。原始定位信息仍作为独立来源证据保留，包括解析缺失或有歧义的情形。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTarget|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The relation is nonfunctional and retains coexisting attributed resolutions. It does not pair each locator literal with a particular target, require a target to be present, equate the entry and target source revisions, or calculate page coordinates. Each resource keeps its own source identity."
msgstr "该关系不具函数性，并保留可共存且注明归属的解析结果。它不将每个定位信息字面值与特定目标配对，不强制要求目标存在，不将条目及目标的来源修订视为相同，也不计算页面坐标。每个资源保留自己的来源身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTarget|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An IndexEntry ex:entry can retain gmeow:indexLocator \"42\" and an attributed gmeow:indexTarget ex:block. The block retains its own gmeow:navigationSource ex:targetRevision; the link is supplied resolution, not a page-coordinate calculation."
msgstr "IndexEntry ex:entry 可以保留 gmeow:indexLocator \"42\" 及注明归属的 gmeow:indexTarget ex:block。该块保留自己的 gmeow:navigationSource ex:targetRevision；此链接是所提供的解析，不是页面坐标计算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTarget|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source or interpretation supplies an actual target block for an index entry while the printed page, range or other locator wording must remain intact."
msgstr "当来源或解释为索引条目提供实际目标块，而印刷页码、范围或其他定位措辞必须保持完整时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTarget|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing indexLocator text, confusing a target block with an indexConcept, inferring a unique resolution or shared revision, or treating the link as a resolver result verified by the vocabulary. Unresolved and competing readings remain explicit."
msgstr "不要替换 indexLocator 文本，不要混淆目标块与 indexConcept，不要推断唯一解析或共享修订，也不要将链接视为经词汇验证的解析器结果。未解析及相互竞争的解读须保持明确。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/indexTarget|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the entry to each supplied ContentBlock and retain its original indexLocator and navigationSource. Preserve the target's own navigationSource and revision evidence when supplied; never fabricate a missing revision. Attribute each indexTarget assertion through its exact native reifier rather than propagating record metadata to outgoing assertions."
msgstr "将条目关联到每个所提供的 ContentBlock，并保留其原始 indexLocator 及 navigationSource。若提供了目标自己的 navigationSource 及修订依据，应予保留；绝不臆造缺失修订。通过每个 indexTarget 断言确切的原生具体化节点记录归属，不要将记录上的元数据传播到其向外断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recognizerLabel|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verbatim recognizer label"
msgstr "识别器原样标签"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recognizerLabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact label string a recognizer reported for this original source occurrence, retained as a reading under that recognizer's actual vantage."
msgstr "识别器为此原始来源出现所报告的确切标签字符串，作为该识别器实际视角下的解读予以保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recognizerLabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The occurrence may cross block boundaries and need not be a block-local Mention. The code preserves spelling and case without asserting class membership, a resolved referent, a score or a model run. Competing attributed labels may coexist."
msgstr "此出现可以跨越多个块的边界，不必是限定在单个块内的 Mention。代码保留其拼写和大小写，不断言类成员关系、已解析的指称对象、分数或模型运行。带有归属信息的相互竞争的标签可以共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recognizerLabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "With its actual recognizer vantage retained on the statement, record ex:occ gmeow:recognizerLabel \"PERSON\" ."
msgstr "在语句上保留识别器的实际视角，并记录 ex:occ gmeow:recognizerLabel \"PERSON\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recognizerLabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a recognizer's supplied label for the exact occurrence it recognized."
msgstr "用于保留识别器为其所识别的确切出现提供的标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recognizerLabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using the code as an entity name, GMEOW class assertion or resolved identity, or copying the original occurrence's label to fragments as if each were independently recognized."
msgstr "避免将代码用作实体名称、GMEOW 类断言或已解析的身份，也不要将原始出现的标签复制到片段上，仿佛每个片段都被独立识别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recognizerLabel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach the supplied xsd:string to the original EvidenceSpan occurrence and retain the actual recognizer vantage on that exact RDF 1.2 statement. Keep unavailable metadata absent and preserve separate attributed readings."
msgstr "将所提供的 xsd:string 附于原始 EvidenceSpan 出现，并在该条确切的 RDF 1.2 语句上保留识别器的实际视角。不可得的元数据保持缺失，并保留彼此独立且带有归属信息的解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rootTokenParse|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported parse of occurrence root token"
msgstr "出现根词元的报告解析"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rootTokenParse|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied TokenParseReport about the parser-selected root token of this original recognized occurrence, under the report's actual analysis context."
msgstr "所提供的 TokenParseReport，描述解析器为此原始识别出现选择的根词元，并保留报告的实际分析上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rootTokenParse|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The occurrence is not equated with its root token. The report can retain supplied syntax without a token identifier, token position, composed form or head slot. Several attributed reports may describe the same occurrence."
msgstr "此出现不等同于其根词元。报告可以在没有词元标识符、词元位置、组合形式或中心词槽位的情况下保留所提供的句法信息。多个带有归属信息的报告可以描述同一出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rootTokenParse|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:occ gmeow:rootTokenParse ex:parse . ex:parse lang:parseInAnalysis ex:analysis ."
msgstr "记录 ex:occ gmeow:rootTokenParse ex:parse . ex:parse lang:parseInAnalysis ex:analysis ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rootTokenParse|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a recognizer supplies syntax for the root token of an occurrence without supplying a composed-form slot tree."
msgstr "用于识别器提供某个出现的根词元句法信息，却未提供组合形式槽位树的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rootTokenParse|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the occurrence as a token or assuming its original root is the root of every block-local fragment."
msgstr "避免将出现视为词元，也不要假定其原始根词元是每个块内片段的根词元。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/rootTokenParse|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the original occurrence to the supplied report, retain the report's parseInAnalysis and actual recognizer attribution, and keep competing reports distinct. Do not manufacture token or head identities."
msgstr "将原始出现链接到所提供的报告，保留报告的 parseInAnalysis 和识别器的实际归属信息，并使相互竞争的报告保持独立。不要虚构词元或中心词的身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceInAnalysisInput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "occurrence in analysis input"
msgstr "分析输入中的出现"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceInAnalysisInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Identifies the Analysis whose selected input text is the context of this reported original occurrence."
msgstr "标识所选输入文本构成此报告原始出现上下文的 Analysis。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceInAnalysisInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This relation selects the input context of the named analysis; it does not make the Analysis result a text carrier. It supplies no input bytes, offset conversion or authentication, and multiple attributed analysis contexts may coexist."
msgstr "此关系选择所指分析的输入上下文，不会将 Analysis 结果变成文本载体。它不提供输入字节、偏移转换或认证，多个带有归属信息的分析上下文可以共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceInAnalysisInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:occ gmeow:occurrenceInAnalysisInput ex:analysis while retaining the supplied input-context descriptors on ex:analysis."
msgstr "记录 ex:occ gmeow:occurrenceInAnalysisInput ex:analysis，并在 ex:analysis 上保留所提供的输入上下文描述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceInAnalysisInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve which analysis input a recognizer's original occurrence report concerns."
msgstr "用于保留识别器的原始出现报告所涉及的分析输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceInAnalysisInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting the containing block for a larger analysis input, treating Analysis as source text, or inferring coordinates in another context."
msgstr "避免用包含该出现的块替代更大范围的分析输入、将 Analysis 视为来源文本，或推断另一上下文中的坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/occurrenceInAnalysisInput|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the occurrence to the actual supplied Analysis context and retain any supplied source-key, construction and granularity descriptors there. Attribute each association without forcing all reports of the occurrence into one analysis."
msgstr "将出现链接到实际提供的 Analysis 上下文，并在该上下文上保留所提供的来源键、构造和粒度描述。为每个关联保留归属信息，不要强制将该出现的所有报告归入同一个分析。"
